This project includes a modified/reimplemented compile-only declaration of
Android's hidden IActivityController interface. The declaration follows the
interface shape in the Android Open Source Project, which is licensed under the
Apache License 2.0. The source file retains the AOSP copyright and license
notice, and the full license is included as LICENSE-APACHE-2.0:

https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/master/core/java/android/app/IActivityController.aidl

The compile-only declaration is excluded from the generated DEX JAR. At
runtime, Android supplies the platform implementation from the boot class path.
